      "pos": {
        "x": 40.0,
        "y": 40.0
      },
      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Extrude pushes a picture out into a slab: solid where its brightness is over Threshold, Depth deep. The Blur softens the letters' edges first, which is what lets a low Steepness draw them smooth and fast \u2014 unplug it and the edges tear. Threshold is 0.25 so the letters come out full. Try Depth and Bevel, or type another word."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
